/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 184 0 R
/E (Your mind can become either a prison or a refuge. Like bricks building a house, repeated thoughts create strongholds. Today you begin the work of tearing down mental fortresses built through fear, anxiety, doubt, and lies. This requires more than one-time prayer. It demands daily discipline to take thoughts captive. Write Scripture everywhere: mirrors, walls, phone screens. When your thoughts align with God's Word, you'll know His voice because it will sound like what you've been rehearsing.)
/Pg 14 0 R
