474 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 201 0 R
/E (You've reached the end of this twelve-day journey. Now learn to rest. Abiding isn't striving; it's remaining connected to the Vine. Like the green roses blooming in ruins, your resurrection life will flourish regardless of circumstances when rooted in Christ. You have access to the Father's house, His lounge, His unlimited provision. Your spiritual inheritance includes adoption, redemption, and eternal life. Today you cease performing and start abiding.)
/Pg 31 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
